# Lab 04 — Windows File Permissions & Access Control

**Project Type:** IT Help Desk Homelab

**Environment:** Windows 11 Pro ARM64 | VMware Fusion | PowerShell

**Focus:** NTFS Permissions, User Access Control, Permission Inheritance, Security Troubleshooting

## 1. Project Overview

This lab simulates a common IT help desk scenario involving a user who requires access to a company folder but should not be permitted to modify its contents.

The objective was to configure Windows NTFS permissions, troubleshoot inherited permissions, and verify access restrictions using PowerShell.

