| Component | Configuration |
|---|---|
| Operating System | Windows 11 Pro ARM64 |
| Virtualization | VMware Fusion |
| Host Machine | Apple Silicon Mac |
| Workstation | HELPDESK-PC01 |
| Test User | Alex Morgan (`amorgan`) |
| Test Folder | `C:\Company-Shared` |
| Test File | `C:\Company-Shared\test.txt` |
